  "solution": "LOGIC: (First Number × 17) - 5 = Second Number\n\nIn **22 ∶ 369 →**\n\n(22 × 17) - 5 = 374 - 5 = 369\n\nAnd; \n\nIn **31 ∶ 522 →**\n\n(31 × 17) - 5 = 527 - 5 = 522\n\nSimilarly;\n\nIn **17 ∶ ? →**\n\n(17 × 17) - 5 = 289 - 5 = 284\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"284\".\n\n7a:T",
